{"strongs": "H1249", "word": "בַּר", "translit": "bar", "root": "ברר", "morph": "H:A", "pos": "adjective", "gloss": "pure, clean", "definition": "II. בַּר adjective pure, clean , Job 11:4 ; Ps 24:4 בָּר Prov 14:4 plural construct בָּרֵי Ps 73:1 feminine בָּרָה Ps 19:9 ; Song 6:9 ; Song 6:10 — 1. pure, clear: בר לבב pure in heart Ps 24:4 ברי לבב Ps 73:1 a pure damsel Song 6:9 ; Song 6:10 , man Job 11:4 , commands of God Ps 19:9 . 2. clean: אֵבוּס בָּר crib is clean Prov 14:4 . 3. perhaps adverb נַשְּׁקובַֿר kiss purely , of sincere homage Ps 2:12 but compare I. בַּר , p. 135.", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1351')\">BDB1351</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H1249')\">H1249</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1350')\">BDB1350</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1352')\">BDB1352</entry></div><p> II. <bdbheb>בַּר</bdbheb> <b>adjective</b> <highlightword>pure, clean</highlightword>, <ref ref=\"Job 11:4\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(18,11,4)\">Job 11:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 24:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,24,4)\">Ps 24:4</ref> <bdbheb>בָּר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 14:4\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(20,14,4)\">Prov 14:4</ref> plural construct <bdbheb>בָּרֵי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 73:1\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"73\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"73\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(19,73,1)\">Ps 73:1</ref> feminine <bdbheb>בָּרָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 19:9\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(19,19,9)\">Ps 19:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Song 6:9\" b=\"22\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(22,6,9)\">Song 6:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Song 6:10\" b=\"22\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(22,6,10)\">Song 6:10</ref> — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>pure, clear:</highlight> <bdbheb>בר לבב</bdbheb> <highligh